      "CDC_NVSS_2023": "CDC National Vital Statistics System, Births Final Data 2023. Age-specific birth rates: 15-17: 5.5/1000, 18-19: 24.6/1000, 20-24: 57.5/1000, 25-29: 93.5/1000, 30-34: 97.5/1000, 35-39: 55.3/1000, 40-44: 12.6/1000.",
      "CDC_NSFG_2015": "CDC National Survey of Family Growth 2011-2015. Marriage disruption: 22% by 5yr, 36% by 10yr, 45% by 15yr, 53% by 20yr.",
      "BLS_Tenure_2024": "Bureau of Labor Statistics, Employee Tenure January 2024. Median tenure: 16-19: 0.7yr, 20-24: 1.2yr, 25-34: 2.7yr, 35-44: 4.6yr, 45-54: 6.8yr, 55-64: 9.6yr.",
      "BLS_Earnings_Q3_2025": "BLS Usual Weekly Earnings Q3 2025. Median weekly: 16-19: $622, 20-24: $796, 25-34: $1150, 35-44: $1385, 45-54: $1377, 55-64: $1322, 65+: $1193.",
      "Fed_SCF_2022": "Federal Reserve Survey of Consumer Finances 2022. Median net worth: <35: $39,040, 35-44: $135,100, 45-54: $246,400, 55-64: $364,260, 65-74: $410,000, 75+: $333,200.",
      "Census_HVS_2024": "Census Housing Vacancies & Homeownership Survey. Rates: <25: 24.8%, 25-29: 35.8%, 30-34: 49.2%, 35-44: 62.0%, 45-54: 70.6%, 55-64: 75.1%, 65-74: 79.5%.",
      "NCI_SEER_2022": "National Cancer Institute SEER 2018-2022. Cancer incidence 445.8/100K/yr. Median diagnosis age 67.",
      "NAR_2024": "National Association of Realtors 2024. Median first-time buyer age: 38 (rose from 31 in 2013).",
      "Gallup_2023": "Gallup retirement surveys. Average retirement age: 62. By 66: 69% retired. By 75: 89% retired.",
      "OPM_2019": "Office of Personnel Management, Retirement Statistics 2015-2019."
    },
    "interpolation_notes": "Between official anchor points, values are derived using monotonic interpolation that respects the shape of life-course curves (logistic for cumulative events, exponential for mortality). Each value tagged: [A] = direct from source, [I] = interpolated from nearest anchors."
  },

